1
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,180
不错嘛
Not so bad.

2
00:00:05,322 --> 00:00:07,292
比外面看起来好
Better than look from outside.

3
00:00:07,292 --> 00:00:10,820
别装酷了闺女 多完美的房间
Drop the cool girl acts. It's perfect.

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,880
我们家房子里居然有霉菌
So, it turns out our house has mold --

5
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,320
并不说明这位优秀主妇持家无方
Which is not a reflection on this excellent homemaker.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,220
不管怎样 在清除霉菌期间
Anyway, we have to vacate the house

7
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,000
我们得搬出来
while it's being treated.

8
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,120
我订到了附近一间旅馆的最后一间房
I got us the last room at a hotel nearby.

9
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,920
五个人共享一间房
I was a little concerned about

10
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,560
让我有点担心
the five of us sharing a room.

11
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,720
不过就一个晚上 没准会很有意思呢
But for one night? I don't know, could be fun.

12
00:00:27,488 --> 00:00:28,292
-看着点 -小心点
- Watch it! - Look out!

13
00:00:28,292 --> 00:00:30,715
海莉 我需要有无线网的角落 下来
Haley, I need the wi-fi corner. Get down.

14
00:00:30,715 --> 00:00:32,129
我需要instagram
Ugh, I need instagram

15
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,340
来知道这世界还是美好的
to know there's still beauty in the world!

16
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,460
卢克 你会把狗吵醒的
Luke, you'll set off the dogs!

17
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,300
瞧瞧我从大厅的自动贩卖机
Look what I got from the vending machine

18
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,980
买到一条查尔斯顿咀嚼糖
in the lobby -- a Charleston Chew.

19
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:41,600
还记得这个吗
Remember these?

20
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,800
有谁能叫那家尼日利亚人
Can someone please tell the Nigerian family

21
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,280
让他们的狗闭嘴吗
to shut their dogs up?!

22
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,700
看这个 根据包装所说
Check it out! According to this wrapper,

23
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,620
我们有机会赢取2005年全明星的门票
we can win tickets to the 2005 all-star game!

24
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,580
我最期待晚上的时光
I think I'm most excited about the night.

25
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,360
-会像露营一样的 -是啊
- It's gonna be like camping. - Yeah.

26
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:55,580
还有人要用洗手间吗
Okay, does anybody else need to use the bathroom?

27
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:56,060
不用了
No.

28
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,460
太好了 终于能躺下了
Great. Oh, finally.

29
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,060
我忘带牙套了
I forgot my night guard.

30
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:02,440
不好意思 妈
Sorry, Mom.

31
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:04,160
我在想什么 这不是我的书
What am I thinking? This isn't my book.

32
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,400
很好 既然都说到了
Great -- now that we talked about it,

33
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,800
我还是再去一次洗手间吧
I need to use the bathroom again.

34
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,740
问你们最后一遍的意义是什么
What is the point of a last call...

35
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:11,124
我要过来了
Coming through!

36
00:01:11,124 --> 00:01:12,053
如果你们还是随心所欲
if you guys are just gonna do whatever -

37
00:01:12,053 --> 00:01:14,990
今晚换人睡浴缸吧 比如海莉
Someone else sleep in the tub tonight. Like Haley.

38
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:20,120
好了 大家都躺下了 能不能
Okay, now that we're all here, can we just --

39
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:20,700
不是吧
No!

40
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:22,760
该死的火车又来了
It's that stupid train.

41
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,233
要把那条该死的狗吵醒了
It's gonna wake up those stupid dogs.

42
00:01:24,233 --> 00:01:26,534
它们又要叫个没完没了
They're gonna start their stupid barking and --

43
00:01:29,621 --> 00:01:30,640
它们没听到
They didn't hear it.

44
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,360
安静 所有人 不要说晚安了
Quiet, everybody. No "Good nights."

45
00:01:50,990 --> 00:01:53,640
该死 雷·查普曼去世了
Son of a gun. Ray Chapman just died.

46
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,260
就是啊
I know!

47
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:57,260
他以前总给我留最好的骨头
He used to give me the best bonings.

48
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,800
你想的是我们的供肉商吧 雷·伊士曼
You're thinking of our butcher -- Ray Eastman.

49
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:00,780
希望是
I hope.

50
00:02:01,004 --> 00:02:02,654
查普曼是我的一个海军朋友
No, Chapman was a navy buddy.

51
00:02:02,654 --> 00:02:04,540
我一直想给他写信
I always meant to write to him.

52
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:05,920
杰 这太让人难过了
Oh, Jay, that's so sad.

53
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:06,920
我恨死他了
I hated his guts.

54
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:09,300
就像人家说的 做事不能总是拖延
It's like they say -- you cannot put these things off.

55
00:02:11,836 --> 00:02:12,968
谢天谢地 曼尼回来了
Thanks god Manny's here.

56
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,320
每次他跟那个
I always get so nervous

57
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:16,700
大点的男孩萨姆一起出去 我都很紧张
when he goes out with that older boy, Sam.

58
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:18,460
我觉得我可以给他的寡妇发个信息
I guess I could try texting the widow.

59
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:20,620
他们每次都那样停在门前
They always stay in the driveway like that.

60
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:21,860
他们在干什么
What are they doing?

61
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,040
杰 去看看
Jay, go look.

62
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,240
歌洛莉亚 你不能去吗
Gloria, can't you do it?

63
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,900
不 我不能去
No, I can't do it because you know

64
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:29,264
因为他总说我管得太多了
that he always say that I am nosey.

65
00:02:29,264 --> 00:02:32,040
曼尼最近的举止很可疑
And Manny's been acting very suspicious lately

66
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:34,840
我觉得是那个男孩的坏影响
I think that that older boy's a bad influence on him.

67
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,300
你能看到吗
Can you see?

68
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,700
看上去他开了一部野马
Looks like he's driving a Mustang.

69
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,380
车不错
Pretty sweet one, too.

70
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:42,140
-该死 -怎么了
- What the hell? - What?

71
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:43,020
他们在亲嘴
They're kissing.

72
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:44,800
萨姆是个女孩
Sam's a girl.

73
00:02:45,198 --> 00:02:46,920
这反倒让你更吃惊吗
That gives a bigger reaction?

74
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:49,320
曼尼有女朋友了 他却没告诉我
Manny has a girlfriend, and he has not told me?

75
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:49,980
他来了
Here he comes,

76
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:51,760
先别急着拿问题轰炸他
and let's not ambush him with a bunch of questions.

77
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:54,431
不 他也许会想表现得酷一点
No. He's probably gonna want to play this pretty cool.

78
00:02:58,460 --> 00:02:59,540
你们好啊
Oh, hey, guys.

79
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,668
我上去了
Well, heading up.

80
00:03:00,668 --> 00:03:01,906
不 等等
No, wait!

81
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:03,600
晚上玩得怎么样
How was your night?

82
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:06,460
你知道的 年轻人的那些
Oh, you know, just teens being teens.

83
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:09,300
不管怎样 明天有大比赛 晚安
Anyway, big game tomorrow. Night.

84
00:03:09,891 --> 00:03:13,594
曼尼的初恋女友是个开野马的高三女生
Manny's first girlfriend is a senior with a Mustang.

85
00:03:13,594 --> 00:03:16,991
我还想赌是个有小胡子的大二生呢
I'd have put my money on a sophomore with a mustache.

86
00:03:18,752 --> 00:03:19,301
你锯那块鸡排
You've been sawing

87
00:03:19,301 --> 00:03:20,809
已经锯了十分钟了
at that chicken fried steak for 10 minutes.

88
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:21,720
叫点别的吃吧
Just order something else.

89
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,580
米奇尔 今天有比赛
Mitchell, it's game day.

90
00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:24,100
我不能吃别的 这是我的幸运餐
I can't. It's my lucky meal.

91
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:26,120
天啊 管它呢
Oh, God. Here we go.

92
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:28,620
真是太有吸引力了
Well, that's attractive.

93
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,960
你看起来像只啃拖鞋的狗狗
You look like a puppy with a slipper.

94
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:32,440
在我的领导下 学校的橄榄球队
Under my leadership, the varsity football team

95
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:35,340
已经创造了5胜0负的令人兴奋的新纪录
is now 5-0 -- new school record, very exciting.

96
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:36,740
小卡 我在这里都能闻到你帽子的臭味
Cam, I can smell your hat from over here.

97
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:38,720
我能把它拿去洗了吗
Can I please just pop it in the laundry?

98
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,800
把幸运洗掉吗 我带着它去所有的比赛
And wash the luck off? I've worn it to every game.

99
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:42,780
他对体育一点都不了解
See, he knows nothing about sports.

100
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:44,000
所以我这回不难为他
That's why I've given him a pass.

101
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,460
他不需要去看比赛
He doesn't have to go to games.

102
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:47,840
但是 我会去的 听说很精彩
Although -- I-I do -- I hear it's fun.

103
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,240
在破木板上坐三个小时
Three hours on a splintery plank

104
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:51,000
旁边都是看到自家小孩弄残别人孩子
with parents squealing with delight

105
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,520
就发出兴奋尖叫的家长
as their children maim each other.

106
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,580
他来了就知道了 现在凳子都是铝制的
He'd know if he came. The seats are aluminum now.

107
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:55,460
好吧
Okay.

108
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:56,520
老板请你吃馅饼 教练
Some pie on the house, coach.

109
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,420
还有 那边那对夫妻帮你买了单
Oh, and that couple over there picked up your tab.

110
00:03:58,740 --> 00:03:59,960
谢谢
Oh! Thank you.

111
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:02,300
至少我还能从这场疯狂里得到点补贴
At least I'm getting some perks out of all this craziness

112
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,920
不 他们只付了你那份
and -- nope, they just covered your part.

113
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:07,300
游泳池就在外面
Lot of pool out there.

114
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,860
要不要玩马可波罗游戏
How about some Marco Polo?

115
00:04:09,860 --> 00:04:11,060
不要
Nah.

116
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,460
像旧时一样在水中嬉戏
Just like the old days, huh?

117
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:12,900
不
No.

118
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:14,460
不行
Not it!

119
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:15,700
老爸 真要这样吗
Dad! Really!

120
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:17,820
好一群爱抱怨的人啊
Bunch of complainers out here, huh?

121
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,700
亲爱的 我出去跑会儿步
Honey, I'm gonna go for a run,

122
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,500
-过会儿说不定能一起游个泳 -好的
- and then maybe after we go for a swim. - Okay.

123
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,120
那是什么
What's that?

124
00:04:26,420 --> 00:04:28,220
一种香体喷雾 叫"性感炸弹"
It's a body spray called Sex Grenade.

125
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:30,780
旅馆里一个离婚男人推荐的
One of the divorced dads in the hotel recommended it.

126
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,820
这味道能把人搞疯
That smell is driving me crazy.

127
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:33,800
说明起作用了
Then it's working.

128
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,780
什么情况 卡住了
What the hell? It's stuck.

129
00:04:41,533 --> 00:04:42,340
离我们远点
Get away from us!

130
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:43,660
没地方躲了
There's nowhere else to go!

131
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,640
我喘不过气来了
I can't breathe!

132
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:46,740
把门打开
Open the door!

133
00:04:50,682 --> 00:04:54,280
这旅馆居然还有清洁服务吗
There's an actual maid service at this hotel?!

134
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,180
老爸 不要
Dad, no!

135
00:04:57,420 --> 00:04:58,620
喷光了
It's empty.

136
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,800
没事了
We're okay, guys.

137
00:05:01,503 --> 00:05:02,920
我去把这个丢掉
I'm gonna toss this.

138
00:05:06,168 --> 00:05:07,862
发生了这种事情
When something like that happens,

139
00:05:08,238 --> 00:05:09,249
真是令人深思
it makes you think, huh?

140
00:05:09,249 --> 00:05:10,586
-卢克 -开什么玩笑
- Luke! - Seriously?!

141
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,140
克莱尔
Claire?

142
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:15,600
我不是
Nope.

143
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,340
我是说 我干什么呢
I mean, what am I doing?

144
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,020
我居然走错房间了
I am totally at the wrong room.

145
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,360
-真的吗 -对不起 菲尔
- Are you? - I'm sorry, Phil.

146
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,240
事情不是你想的那样
It's not what it looks like.

147
00:05:21,981 --> 00:05:24,800
皱了的床 红酒...
Rumpled bed, wine...

148
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:24,940
胸罩
bra.

149
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,300
我就知道
I knew it!

150
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,900
你一个人睡觉了
You've been sleeping by yourself.

151
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,940
你怎么能这样
How could you?

152
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:35,100
对不起 我实在是受不了了
I am so sorry. I just couldn't take it anymore,

153
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:37,400
我需要一个地方 这是什么味道
and I needed a place where -- What is that smell?

154
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,280
背叛的味道
Betrayal.

155
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:44,640
在客厅举行家庭议会
Family meeting in the living room.

156
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,800
-我们不是已经 -快到客厅
- Aren't we already in -- - In the living room!

157
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:50,240
真不知道该怎么把这话说出口
There's no easy way to say this.

158
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,860
你们母亲要离开我们了
Your mother's leaving us.

159
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:53,540
她找到了另一个可以让她快乐的房间
She's found another room that makes her happy.

160
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:54,500
我不明白
I don't understand.

161
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:56,100
这不是你的错
It's not your fault.

162
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:57,940
听着 我需要一些空间
Okay, look, I needed a little space,

163
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:59,640
而正好那边有一个房间空出来了
and there was a room that opened up down the hall --

164
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:01,520
然后就一发不可收拾了
Then one thing led to another.

165
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:02,660
你走吧 克莱尔
Spare us, Claire.

166
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,320
慢着 老妈在别的房间睡觉吗
So, wait. Mom's staying in that other room?

167
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,720
你可以在周末拜访她
You can visit her on the weekends.

168
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:08,480
我们不是再待一天就可以了吗
Aren't we here for just one more day?

169
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,100
我就知道你会最先发火
I knew you'd be the one to lash out.

170
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:13,220
如果老妈要住在空房间
If Mom is staying in an empty room,

171
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:15,060
我们何不让几个人过去跟她住
why can't some of us stay with her?

172
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:15,860
你高兴了吧 克莱尔
You happy, Claire?

173
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,540
你拆散了整个家庭
You're breaking up the family.

174
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,600
不 孩子们 爸爸说得对
No, guys, your father is right.

175
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,640
都是我的错
This is my fault.

176
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,260
我还是回我的房间
I should go back to my room

177
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,560
好好反省我的过错吧
and just think about what I've done.

178
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,500
别这样 我们恨死这里了
Come on. We hate it here.

179
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:26,700
我多一秒都不想
I cannot look at that red hair

180
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:28,320
再瞧见浴室排水槽里的红发了
in the shower drain one more second.

181
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:30,700
睁大眼睛瞧瞧 我们几个没人是红头发
Look around here, people. None of us have red hair.

182
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:32,360
好吧 你们其中一人得跟妈妈走
Okay, one of you has to go with your mom,

183
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:34,240
我们用民主的方法来决定
so we'll do this the democratic way.

184
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,880
谁抽到了最短的披萨边
Whoever pulls the short crust --

185
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:37,580
-别呀 老爸 -我不想抽签
- Come on, Dad. - No, I don't want to do that.

186
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:37,940
好吧
Fine!

187
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:40,180
如果你们都想走 就走吧
You all want to go, then go.

188
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:42,000
背叛自己的亲生父亲
Turn your back on your father,

189
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:42,920
不需要你们
just spare me

190
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:45,160
-虚情假意的道歉和鳄鱼... -好
- the empty apologies and the crocodile... -Okay.

191
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:45,660
-终于可以走了 -...泪
- Finally. - tears.

192
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:46,600
我不睡浴缸
I call "No bathtub."

193
00:06:48,766 --> 00:06:51,400
又是个好运礼物篮 大爸
Another good-luck gift basket, Daddy.

194
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,480
他们居然让七岁小孩签收
Oh, they just let 7-year-olds sign for these. Okay.

195
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,860
不错呀
How nice!

196
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,360
来看看里面有什么
Let's see what we've got here.

197
00:06:57,660 --> 00:06:58,640
茄子果冻
Eggplant jelly?

198
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:00,240
难以想象他们不喜欢你的话
What do they send if they

199
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,140
会送什么鬼东西
don't like you?

200
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,280
教练加油 海豚队加油
"Go coach, go Dolphins!"

201
00:07:04,024 --> 00:07:06,440
看上去"加油"加得有点过
I don't know. It seems a little "Go" heavy.

202
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,220
粉红盐
Pink salt?

203
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,960
人们现在都是什么毛病
What is wrong with people?

204
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,860
我得赶紧走了
Okay, I got to skedaddle.

205
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:12,680
比赛结束后再见
I'll see you guys after the big game.

206
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:13,940
好的 再见
All right, then.

207
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:16,380
-这还没完 因为 -忘拿钥匙了
- And we're waiting because... - Forgot my keys.

208
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,460
是的 在那里
Yes, you did. Right over there.

209
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,820
-每次都要这样 -是的 每一次
- Every time. - Yes, every time.

210
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:22,920
我们第一次赢球那天我就忘拿了
I forgot them on the day of our first win,

211
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:24,700
这招屡试不爽
and it's worked ever since.

212
00:07:24,780 --> 00:07:25,740
往左边挪一下
Now scooch to the left.

213
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:27,860
我不能让你再搞那个咖啡桌的把戏了
I'm not letting you do the coffee-table thing again.

214
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:30,240
米奇尔 迷信是体育的重要组成部分
Mitchell, superstitions are a big part of sports.

215
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,439
同样也是巫术和邪教以及巫毒术的一部分
And witchcraft and cults and voodoo, but --

216
00:07:32,439 --> 00:07:34,420
听我说 你知道吗
Hey, look, you know what?

217
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:35,960
我没逼你喜欢橄榄球
I'm not asking you to like football,

218
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:37,740
可我喜欢橄榄球
but I like football.

219
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:40,220
在我的成长过程中 橄榄球是我的一切
Football was everything to me growing up.

220
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:41,820
我原来只是个农场胖基佬
I was just a big, gay farm kid

221
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:45,060
可当我加入橄榄球队以后我终于被接受了
until I joined the football team and I finally fit in.

222
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,300
我不期望你会喜欢
Now, I don't expect you to like it.

223
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:49,340
我不期望你会来看比赛
I don't expect you to come to the games.

224
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:53,980
但我期望你能表现得不那么傲慢
But I do expect you to be 5% less condescending.

225
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,100
给我让开
Now scooch.

226
00:07:59,460 --> 00:08:00,500
加油 海豚队
Go, Dolphins!

227
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:05,160
太过头了 车钥匙 咖啡桌
It's too much -- the car keys, the coffee table,

228
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:07,369
你放在正门口的滑板
your roller skate on the front porch.

229
00:08:07,783 --> 00:08:09,760
这里面有巧克力吗
I-is there any chocolate in any of these?

230
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:13,250
你得从这罐番茄干上刮下来
You'll have to scrape it off this sun-dried tomato.

231
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:14,280
我觉得某种意义上
I suppose on some level,

232
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:16,120
他说的可能有道理
it's possible that he might have a point.

233
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,560
我不喜欢体育 真的
I hate sports. I do.

234
00:08:17,820 --> 00:08:20,920
可如果你是我爸用他的教育方式带大的
But if you had my dad and my upbringing...

235
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:23,520
你有玩游戏最后才被选的经历吗 莉莉
I mean, have you ever been picked last for a team, Lily?

236
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,820
那天在体育馆 那些坏女孩...
Well, at gym the other day, these mean girls --

237
00:08:25,820 --> 00:08:28,740
你肯定没体会过 成天被欺负和嘲笑
I mean, you have no idea, Lily, the bullying and the teasing.

238
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:29,900
她们把我放到了球袋里
They put me in the ball bag.

239
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,520
如果我真的表现得很傲慢
If I am a little dismissive,

240
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:33,640
只是因为我悲惨的身世
it's only because of my harrowing backstory.

241
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:36,240
她们说我敢告诉别人就杀了你和大爸
They said if I told, they would kill you and daddy.

242
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,580
我的天
Oh, my god.

243
00:08:37,764 --> 00:08:39,980
我一直在考虑自己
I've -- I've been making this all about myself.

244
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:41,760
一点都没为小卡着想
I haven't even been thinking about Cam.

245
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:44,180
这都什么事啊
This is crazy.

246
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,400
就是 都什么事啊
Yes, this is crazy.

247
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,300
谁关心我爱不爱橄榄球啊
Who cares if I like football?

248
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:48,500
大爸喜欢
Daddy likes football,

249
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:51,440
我爱大爸 所以 我要告诉他
and I like daddy, so -- I need to tell him.

250
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,140
告诉他我会更支持他
I need to tell him I'm gonna be more supportive,

251
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:56,100
还要 亲爱的 你在帮我打给他吗
and I need to -- oh, honey, are you calling him for me?

252
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,920
对 我要投诉
Yes, I have a complaint.

253
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,940
我想找哈利或戴维
Can I please talk to Harry or David?

254
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,460
什么味道
What's that smell?

255
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:06,700
你说的应该是我奔放的新香水吧
I believe you're referring to my bold new scent --

256
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:08,000
"性感炸弹"
"Sex gre-nod."

257
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,200
是不是为萨姆喷的 那个名字
Is that for Sam, your friend that is a girl,

258
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:12,160
像男生的女生朋友
but has the name of a boy?

259
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:13,960
我知道你昨晚在偷看我
I knew you were spying on me last night.

260
00:09:14,380 --> 00:09:15,440
对 我有女朋友了
Yes, I have a girlfriend.

261
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,660
我就直说了 省得你去打听
Let me save you some snooping.

262
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:19,560
她聪明 漂亮 读高三
She's smart. She's pretty. She's a senior.

263
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:21,460
是我们学校的交际花
She's our high school's "It" Girl,

264
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,700
此花为了我甩了篮球队长
and "It" Dumped the captain of the basketball team for me.

265
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:26,760
你才十五岁 就跟高三的约会了
So, you're only 15, and you go out with the senior.

266
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:28,280
你真想来这套吗
Are you sure you want to play that game?

267
00:09:29,060 --> 00:09:29,640
你想吗
Are you?

268
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,080
我只是想
I just want to --

269
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,200
妈 你管太多了
Mom, you're butting in.

270
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,760
我只想见见她
I just want to meet her.

271
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,000
绝对不行
Oh, absolutely not.

272
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,260
还太早
It's way too early.

273
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:38,240
能不能保证在我准备好之前都别过问这事
Promise me you'll stay out of this until I'm ready.

274
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:41,580
这是最接近"好"的答案了
That's as close as you're gonna get to a "Yes."

275
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,000
好了 我要去收拾了
Okay, I got to go get ready.

276
00:09:43,380 --> 00:09:45,220
萨姆会来接我 在赛前吃点东西
Sam's gonna pick me up for a bite before the game.

277
00:09:46,580 --> 00:09:47,840
杰 我不喜欢
Jay, I don't like this.

278
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,420
虽然不是我最喜欢的退场方式
Eh, it's not my favorite exit of his,

279
00:09:49,420 --> 00:09:51,040
不过比鞠躬谢幕好多了
but it beats the dramatic stage bow.

280
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:53,040
不是说这个 那女生比他成熟太多了
No, that girl is too advanced for him.

281
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:55,160
我不希望她强迫曼尼
I don't want her to force him

282
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:57,140
做他不想做的事
to do anything that he doesn't want to.

283
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,280
我倒觉得不论那女孩想做什么他都能应付
I think he'll be okay with whatever she wants to do.

284
00:09:59,859 --> 00:10:02,280
你快去 我不能插手
Okay, you go because I cannot butt in.

285
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,420
你可以去跟她说
Maybe you can talk to her.

286
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:06,100
吓唬她一下 把她镇住
Maybe you can put the fear of God into her!

287
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:07,136
怎样 砸碎她的挡风玻璃
What, bust her windshield?

288
00:10:07,146 --> 00:10:08,040
扭断小指吗
Break her pinkie?

289
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,780
我这就去把监控关了
I go disconnect the security camera.

290
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:14,760
车不错啊
Nice ride.

291
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,440
谢谢
Thanks.

292
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,880
其实 曼尼并不习惯
You know, Manny's not really used to...

293
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,860
坐快车
fast cars.

294
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:21,081
我不知道你开着这辆野马
And I don't know what your intentions are

295
00:10:21,081 --> 00:10:22,562
到底想干什么 不过
with this Mustang, but, um,

296
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:27,540
我建议你凡事都要慢慢来
I suggest you take things nice and slow.

297
00:10:28,682 --> 00:10:29,360
明白了吗
We clear?

298
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:32,120
听起来你是想让我开慢点
Um, sounds like you really want me to drive slow.

299
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:35,047
不是 我想说的是
No, uh, what I think I'm saying is,

300
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:36,740
用手就好了
hands can do things.

301
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:38,484
不对 等下
No, uh, hang on.

302
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:41,820
年轻人有欲望很正常
Young people have urges, which is only natural.

303
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,640
我也有
I also have urges.

304
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,360
好吧
Okay.

305
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,380
我是说 你够十八岁了
I mean, the point is, you're 18.

306
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:47,720
我盯着你呢[看上你了]
And I have my eye on you.

307
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,100
杰 你在干什么
Jay, what are you doing?

308
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,020
回屋去
Go inside.

309
00:10:51,940 --> 00:10:52,780
说了不插手的
No means no!

310
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:54,340
冲
Run!

311
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:55,880
得分
Score!

312
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:58,100
赢了
Win!

313
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,500
太棒了
Yes!

314
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:02,280
第二节只剩四分钟
And with 4 minutes left in the second quarter...

315
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:03,700
海豚队27分
...that's Dolphins -- 27...

316
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:04,880
獾队 零分
...Badgers -- nothing.

317
00:11:04,890 --> 00:11:07,468
漂亮 打得真精彩
All right! What a game!

318
00:11:07,479 --> 00:11:08,600
我们的队员就像是
Our guys were playing like

319
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,440
穷人家孩子在和富二代们打比赛似的
they come from a much poorer neighborhood.

320
00:11:10,660 --> 00:11:11,440
你不觉得奇怪吗
You don't think it's funny

321
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:13,130
都没见到那女生 萨姆
that we haven't seen that girl, Sam,

322
00:11:13,140 --> 00:11:14,180
取个男生名的那个
the one named for a boy?

323
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,680
这比赛这么重要
I mean, it's a big game.

324
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,160
她如果真是曼尼的女朋友 就该
If she was really his girlfriend, she --

325
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:18,380
歌洛莉亚 现实点吧
Gloria, be realistic.

326
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:19,180
你想她怎样
What do you want,

327
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:20,540
站在第一排
her standing in the first row

328
00:11:20,540 --> 00:11:22,320
举个写着"曼尼加油"的牌子吗
with a sign saying "Go, Manny"?

329
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:25,108
-我只是说 -她就是这么做的
- I'm just saying that... - 'Cause that's what she's doing.

330
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:26,180
那是她吗
That's her?

331
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:27,940
还挺漂亮的嘛
She's pretty.

332
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:31,600
那牌子是她做的吗
She made that sign for him?

333
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:32,700
跟你说了她是个不错的女孩
I told you, she's a great girl.

334
00:11:32,780 --> 00:11:34,420
你看 她还用了荧光粉
And look -- she used glitter,

335
00:11:34,420 --> 00:11:35,780
真有一套
for god's sakes.

336
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:38,260
杰 我觉得她真的很喜欢曼尼 看
Jay, I think that she really likes him. Look.

337
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:41,060
她望着曼尼的眼神跟我看曼尼的眼神一样
She looks at him the same way that I look at him.

338
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:42,020
好甜蜜
So sweet.

339
00:11:42,060 --> 00:11:43,860
但她有这种眼神是正常的
And in her case, healthy.

340
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:45,760
加油 海豚队
Go, Dolphins!

341
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,560
今晚我们队球迷的门票钱
We're really giving our fans

342
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,480
花得真值 孩子们
their money's worth tonight, boys.

343
00:11:51,103 --> 00:11:52,402
他来了
He came.

344
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:55,040
他跑到了30码线 20码
He's at the 30, at the 20,

345
00:11:55,260 --> 00:11:57,720
10码 入禁区了 触地得分
the 10, and he's in for a touchdown.

346
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,420
-獾队得分 -什么
- Badgers score. - What?!

347
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:02,200
我们一整年都没被人那样反击过
We haven't let anyone run back a kick all year.

348
00:12:02,300 --> 00:12:03,120
怎么回事
What happened?

349
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,400
快跑 拦截
Run! Tackle!

350
00:12:15,300 --> 00:12:15,640
给我上
Try!

351
00:12:17,820 --> 00:12:18,840
獾队触地得分
Touchdown, Badgers.

352
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:20,220
到底怎么回事 教练
What's going on, coach?

353
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,920
大家忽然都不在状态
All of a sudden, everyone's just off.

354
00:12:22,100 --> 00:12:22,440
对
Yep.

355
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,660
不过米奇尔终于来看比赛了
At least Mitchell finally made it to a game.

356
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:25,160
对
Yep.

357
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:29,880
注意力集中 防守的
Focus, defense.

358
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,820
他们队有两个人防着我们
They got two players hurting us.

359
00:12:31,940 --> 00:12:34,440
两个人有那么难防吗
It's not that much to keep track of!

360
00:12:34,843 --> 00:12:36,387
该死 忘放芥末酱了
Shoot. Mustard.

361
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:44,620
我不能告诉曼尼 他会难过死的
I couldn't tell Manny because it would kill him,

362
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:45,880
也不能告诉歌洛莉亚
and I couldn't tell Gloria

363
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,260
她气急了我会死的
because she would kill me.

364
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:49,900
好好的热狗就这么给毁了
Hell of a way to ruin a nice hot dog.

365
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:52,527
第三节结束 双方打成平手
End of the third quarter, and we're all tied up.

366
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:53,300
塔克教练
Coach Tucker!

367
00:12:53,838 --> 00:12:56,154
大家都过来喝点水
Okay, hey, everybody, grab a cup of water.

368
00:12:56,154 --> 00:12:58,260
水杯你们还能拿得住吧
Maybe you could hold on to those, huh?

369
00:12:58,260 --> 00:13:00,380
多精彩啊
How exciting is this, huh?

370
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,600
你的记事版掉了
Oh, you dropped your little clipboard.

371
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,860
我以为你今晚有应酬
I thought you had a work dinner tonight.

372
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:03,880
是的 不过我推掉了
I did, but I blew them off.

373
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,380
我更想到这来支持你的球队
I'd rather be here supporting the team.

374
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:06,660
加油 海豚队
You better go, Dolphins!

375
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,560
是啊 真好 不过比赛快结束了
Yeah, love that, but, you know, the game's almost over.

376
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:10,060
要是不想赶上堵车的话 就...
You might want to beat traffic, so...

377
00:13:10,060 --> 00:13:11,300
我以为我来观赛你会高兴
I thought you'd be happy that I was here.

378
00:13:11,300 --> 00:13:12,920
可我怎么觉得你急着想摆脱我
Why do I feel like you're trying to get rid of me?

379
00:13:12,940 --> 00:13:14,660
我也不知道 我没说你是扫把星
I have no idea. It's not because you're a jinx.

380
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:17,020
扫把星 你认为我是扫把星吗
A jinx? Do you think I'm a jinx?

381
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:18,520
不 不不不不不
No! No, no, no, no, no.

382
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,880
这不会都是你的错
This all can't be on you.

383
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,000
可我觉得听起来
I'm hearing a lot of things

384
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:23,040
跟你嘴上说的刚好相反
that sound like the opposite of what you're --

385
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:24,480
教练 我们需要你部署战略
Hey, coach! We need a play.

386
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,920
还有马尔科姆刚刚被蜜蜂蜇了
And Malcolm just got stung by a bee.

387
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:27,080
我得走了 怎么会有蜜蜂
I got to go. A bee?!

388
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,540
快去弄点小苏打来
Okay, get some baking soda.

389
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:33,340
你们知道酒吧在哪吗
Hey, do you guys know where the bar is?

390
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:34,580
这里就是 老兄
You're here, my friend.

391
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:35,720
想来点什么
What are you in the mood for?

392
00:13:35,820 --> 00:13:37,460
我想让妻子和孩子们回来
Well, I'd like my wife and kids back,

393
00:13:37,460 --> 00:13:38,400
但先来杯夏敦埃酒好了
but I'd take a chardonnay.

394
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:41,360
看你表情就知道没什么好事
Ah, I thought you had that look about you.

395
00:13:41,660 --> 00:13:43,320
我是莱斯特 这位是卡尔
I'm Lester. This is Carl.

396
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,430
-你好 卡尔 -你好
- Hey, Carl. - Hey.

397
00:13:44,430 --> 00:13:46,457
我知道你现在很伤心 不过
I know it hurts now, but, uh,

398
00:13:46,457 --> 00:13:47,900
作一个花花公子
being a man-about-town,

399
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:50,840
独来独往 将会有意外的惊喜
on your own, has its perks.

400
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,920
这杯算我请你的
This is on me.

401
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:54,438
谁离开谁的
Ah. So, who left who?

402
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:55,180
她离开我的
She did.

403
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:57,240
她说需要空间
She said she needed some space,

404
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:59,120
自己找了间房 把孩子们带走了
got her own place, and took the kids.

405
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,000
别灰心 老兄
Chin up, my friend.

406
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,360
更多的精彩在等待着你
Adventure awaits.

407
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,100
卡尔 能帮我刷一下卡吗
Carl, could you swipe me?

408
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:06,209
玉米片机把我的卡吞了
Nacho machine ate my card.

409
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:06,760
菲尔
Phil.

410
00:14:06,923 --> 00:14:09,226
你好 阿尤拉 这是我的邻居
Hey, Ayoola. This is my neighbor here.

411
00:14:09,226 --> 00:14:10,960
-去泳池吗 -不去了 谢谢
- Pool? - Oh, no, thanks.

412
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:13,060
-现在没有那个心情 -好吧
- I don't think I'd be much fun right now. - Okay.

413
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,040
菲尔 老兄
Phil, buddy,

414
00:14:15,051 --> 00:14:17,304
接到这样的邀请 就应该赶紧上啊
you get an offer like that, you got to jump on it,

415
00:14:17,304 --> 00:14:19,000
就算只是一夜风流也好
even if it's just a one-time thing.

416
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,820
我不知道 她人不错 孩子也挺可爱
I don't know -- she's nice, her kids seem great,

417
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,920
但我都不会说她的语言
but I don't even speak her language.

418
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,320
谁让你跟她说话了
Who said anything about speaking?

419
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:27,020
我想你们俩误会了
I think you guys have got the wrong idea.

420
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,540
我妻子明天会回来的
My wife's getting back tomorrow.

421
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,980
她当然会回来 小冠军
Oh, of course she is, champ.

422
00:14:30,980 --> 00:14:33,700
我只是想说 生命苦短
Uh, I'm just saying, life is short,

423
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:36,180
找点无伤大雅的乐子又有何妨
and why deny yourself a little innocent fun?

424
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:37,840
你妻子她就没顾忌那么多
Your wife certainly hasn't.

425
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,900
我觉得自己还没准备好
I'm not sure I'm up for it.

426
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:43,780
好吧 但不要让好生活等太久 菲尔
Okay, but don't wait too long to start living life, Phil.

427
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:46,500
多谢 伙计们
Thanks, guys.

428
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,640
知道吗 当你不去想
You know when you don't think about

429
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:50,720
在你之前谁曾进过这里
who was in there before you,

430
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,600
在旅馆浴缸泡澡其实很让人放松
a hotel bath can be really quite relaxing.

431
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:54,960
艾丽克斯收到我的信息了吗
Do you know if Alex got my text?

432
00:14:55,361 --> 00:14:57,780
给你刷卡买的酒
Your swipe-card wine.

433
00:14:57,780 --> 00:14:58,800
谢谢
Thank you.

434
00:14:59,180 --> 00:14:59,820
刚才我在大厅里
Hey, so, I was talking

435
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:01,180
跟那几个苦闷男人聊天
to those sad guys that are in the lobby,

436
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:03,244
他们说旅馆这周半数房间都空着
and they said the hotel's been half-empty all week.

437
00:15:03,254 --> 00:15:04,100
是半数房间住满了 宝贝儿
Half-full, honey.

438
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:05,440
生活中要保持乐观的态度
Be positive for once in your life.

439
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:07,220
好的 但这不是我想表达的意思
Okay, not quite the point I was making.

440
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:08,820
我很想听你表达你的意思 不过现在
I want to hear your point, but right now,

441
00:15:08,820 --> 00:15:10,440
这杯神奇的果汁会让妈妈
this magic juice is gonna help mama

442
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,700
在浴缸里体验池滨酒吧的乐趣
turn that bathtub into a swim-up bar.

443
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:13,880
我要说的是 我们从一开始就可以
I'm just saying we could have been

444
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,940
-开两间房分开住 -好吧
- in two hotel rooms this entire time. - Okay.

445
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:16,520
等等
Wait.

446
00:15:16,533 --> 00:15:19,060
你是说爸爸让我们无缘无故遭了这么多罪
So, dad put us through hell for nothing?

447
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,180
你们听见了吗
Do you guys hear that?

448
00:15:20,420 --> 00:15:22,680
我的英雄从圣坛上掉下的声音吗
The sound of my hero falling off his pedestal?

449
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:23,600
不是
Uh, no.

450
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,020
你的英雄在泳池
The sound of your hero

451
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:27,120
和那些尼日利亚人嬉戏的声音
playing with the Nigerians in the pool.

452
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,680
好了 当我说"马可"时
Okay, so, when I say "Marco" --

453
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,160
-你好 马可 -不不 我是菲尔
- Hi, Marco. - No, no, I'm Phil.

454
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:34,740
我要说的是"马可" 然后
I'm gonna say "Marco" and then --

455
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:35,240
你好 菲尔
Hi, Phil.

456
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,000
我们重新再来
Let's take it from the top.

457
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:38,540
我要闭上我的眼睛
I'm gonna close my eyes.

458
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:40,147
不不不 不是你 阿尤拉
No, no, not -- not you, Ayoola.

459
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,120
你睁着眼睛就好
You keep your eyes open.

460
00:15:41,260 --> 00:15:41,960
-你能睁开... -马可
- Can you open... - Marco!

461
00:15:41,971 --> 00:15:44,611
不 易亚卜 不要离开泳池
No, uh, Iyapo, can you stay in the pool?

462
00:15:44,611 --> 00:15:46,229
-这样当我说"马可" -你好马可
- That way, when I say "Marco" - Hi, Marco.

463
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,120
天哪
Come on.

464
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:49,820
整个房间都是他的 他却在干这个吗
He has a room to himself, and that's what he's doing?

465
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:51,000
我们应该感到惊讶吗
How surprised should we be?

466
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:52,460
他基本上就是个极度活跃的小孩子
I mean, he's basically a hyperactive toddler

467
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:53,980
整天都想着玩儿
that just wants to play all the time.

468
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:54,380
没错
Yeah.

469
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,420
但其实他真正想要的
Although it's really more about

470
00:15:56,420 --> 00:15:57,800
是和我们在一起
wanting to spend time with us.

471
00:15:58,480 --> 00:16:00,220
这基本上是爸爸的全部心愿
It's kind of all dad ever wants.

472
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:01,820
你说得对
That's true.

473
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:03,860
他就好像 总喜欢缠着我们
He's, like, obsessed with us.

474
00:16:04,580 --> 00:16:06,340
你们觉得他骗我们旅馆客满了
Do you think he lied about the hotel being booked

475
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:07,900
是为了能和我们待在一起吗
just so we'd all have to spend time together?

476
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:10,860
可我们却抛弃了他
And we totally ditched him.

477
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:13,780
他甚至为了我们扑到那瓶性感炸弹香水上
Even after he jumped on that sex grenade for us.

478
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:19,300
手太滑了 酒撒到浴缸里了
Butterfingers. I spilled my wine in the tub.

479
00:16:19,740 --> 00:16:21,260
能再给我来一杯吗 宝贝儿
Would you mind, sweetie?

480
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,180
怎么了
What?

481
00:16:24,236 --> 00:16:25,712
还剩6秒钟
Only 6 seconds left.

482
00:16:25,712 --> 00:16:27,444
海豚队还落后三分
The dolphins still down by 3.

483
00:16:27,444 --> 00:16:29,299
短短40码 长长的6秒
40 short yards, 6 long seconds.

484
00:16:29,299 --> 00:16:30,320
我们可以的
We've got this.

485
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,220
数到三一起来"加油 海豚"
On three, "Go, dolphins."

486
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:32,700
二三 加油 海豚
Two, three go, dolphins!

487
00:16:32,843 --> 00:16:35,159
好了 曼尼 只求上天保佑了
All right, Manny, this is a real hail mary.

488
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:38,440
无论输赢 我依然有个漂亮女友
Win or lose, I still have a hot girlfriend.

489
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,380
海豚队来到场边
Dolphins come to the line.

490
00:16:41,053 --> 00:16:42,360
断球了
There's the snap.

491
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,540
汤米·帕克回传
Tommy Park back to pass.

492
00:16:43,540 --> 00:16:44,821
-他看到前场 -快传
- He looks downfield. - Hit it.

493
00:16:44,821 --> 00:16:47,050
-快传快传 -传给了接球手
- Hit it! Hit it! - He's got a receiver.

494
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,560
海豚队触地得分
Touchdown, dolphins!

495
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:50,480
我们赢了 米奇尔 我们赢了
We won! Mitchell, we won!

496
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,000
不要
Oh, no!

497
00:16:57,780 --> 00:16:59,660
-喂 -米奇尔 我们赢了
- Hello? - Mitchell, we won!

498
00:16:59,671 --> 00:17:01,240
我回头看 你不在了
And I looked back, and you weren't there!

499
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,460
请别生我的气
Please don't be mad at me.

500
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:03,640
我在栅栏上[持观望态度]
I'm on the fence.

501
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:05,200
我不怪你
I don't blame you.

502
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:08,200
我真傻 让你感觉这一切是你的错
I feel stupid for making you think this was all your fault.

503
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:11,380
不 我在栅栏上
No! I'm on the fence.

504
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:12,560
看你右边
Look to your right.

505
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:19,500
我想离开
I was trying to leave,

506
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:21,371
结果被卡住了
and then I got stuck on this fence With --

507
00:17:21,371 --> 00:17:22,360
我的裤腿
my -- my pant leg is --

508
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:23,220
你在想什么呢
What were you thinking?

509
00:17:23,340 --> 00:17:24,860
我们都知道你不擅长攀爬
We both know you're not a good climber.

510
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:25,380
我知道
Well, I know that.

511
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,040
那边就有停车场
There's a parking lot right over there.

512
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,240
我把车停这里了
I'm parked over here.

513
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:31,340
稳住 稳住
Sit right -- sit right -- sit right there.

514
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:31,420
稳住了
Sit right there.

515
00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:33,460
-好了 放我下来 -二 三
- Okay, okay, put me down. - Two, three.

516
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,352
你不用把我扔出去吧
You don't have to throw me.

517
00:17:35,860 --> 00:17:37,780
我明白你为什么不想让我来这里
Look, I -- I get why you don't want me here.

518
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:39,918
我知道不存在什么噩运
I-I know there's no such thing as bad luck,

519
00:17:39,918 --> 00:17:41,620
但是存在负能量
But there -- there is bad energy,

520
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:44,380
我给你的体育世界带去了不少负能量
And I bring a lot of that to your whole sports world.

521
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:46,260
那是因为我和体育有段纠结的过去
And that's -- that's because of my own history with it

522
00:17:47,314 --> 00:17:48,560
我应该做得更好才对
and you deserve better.

523
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:50,920
你已经最好了 知道吗
I couldn't do better. You know what?

524
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:53,400
咱们何不把体育看作是朋友当中
Why can't we look at sports like one of those friends

525
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,680
你们二人一个喜欢一个讨厌的那种
that one of us likes and the other doesn't?

526
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:57,220
体育就像你妈妈
Sports can be like your mom.

527
00:17:58,519 --> 00:18:01,520
其实吧 我不讨厌这个
You know, actually, I-I didn't hate this.

528
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:03,000
-少来了 -不 我不讨厌
- Oh, shut up. - No, I didn't.

529
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,260
我有些领略到橄榄球文化了
I-I was kind of getting into the whole football culture.

530
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:07,172
其中有种高雅
There is an elegance that this has --

531
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:08,500
不
No!

532
00:18:08,533 --> 00:18:10,945
不 这可是骆马毛的
No! This is vicuna!

533
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,984
你们这些原始人
You neanderthals!

534
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:17,880
精彩的比赛 冠军
Great game, champ.

535
00:18:18,140 --> 00:18:18,600
谢谢
Thanks.

536
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:19,840
你还好吗
You okay?

537
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:21,920
只是有些累了
Yeah, just a little tired.

538
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,760
今天很累 晚安
It was a big day. Good night.

539
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:24,280
晚安 孩子
Night, kid.

540
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,680
稍等
Hey, wait a second.

541
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,420
你们队刚刚连赢六场
Your team just won six straight.

542
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:30,820
咱们用威士忌来庆祝下
Let's celebrate with a little scotch.

543
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:32,680
你已经大到可以抿第一口了
You're old enough for your first sip.

544
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:34,380
她甩了我 杰
She dumped me, Jay.

545
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:36,060
咱们来说说
Okay, we're gonna do this.

546
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:39,460
她只是利用我让她年长的男友嫉妒
She was just using me to make her old boyfriend jealous.

547
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:41,000
现在他们复合了
Now they're back together.

548
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:42,960
不要告诉妈妈 好吗
Don't tell mom, okay?

549
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:44,800
我感觉到她不喜欢萨姆
I had a sense she didn't like Sam.

550
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:45,960
是吗 她什么也没说
Really? She didn't say anything.

551
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,360
我的初恋女友
My first girlfriend.

552
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:49,740
她好完美
She was perfect.

553
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:51,240
屁股有点大
Eh, a little wide in the can.

554
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,140
-杰 -对不起
- Jay. - I'm sorry. Just...

555
00:18:53,140 --> 00:18:54,060
要我说 你很幸运
You ask me, you're lucky.

556
00:18:54,300 --> 00:18:55,580
她发短信甩我的
She dumped me by text

557
00:18:55,580 --> 00:18:57,180
当时还在和她年长的男友热吻
while making out with her old boyfriend.

558
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:01,000
我崩溃哭泣 炭笔条花得跟睫毛膏一样
I broke down crying. My charcoal ran like mascara.

559
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,960
来得靠另一队的吉利物安慰我来着
I had to be comforted by the other team's mascot.

560
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:06,000
-这是幸运吗 -好好想想
- Lucky? - Think about it.

561
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:08,600
你这个年纪有多少男生
How many guys your age would kill

562
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:10,160
愿意付出一切让萨姆利用
to be used by a girl like Sam?

563
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:11,460
她选了你
She picked you.

564
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,100
她利用了你
She used you.

565
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,060
我就是个泄欲工具 杰
I was a body, Jay.

566
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:17,440
拜托 如果她选了个普通男生
Come on. If she had picked an average guy,

567
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:19,900
那个男友根本不会嫉妒
that boyfriend never would have got jealous.

568
00:19:20,620 --> 00:19:23,320
她得选一个和那个男友一个水平的
She had to pick a guy on his level.

569
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:24,900
是 可能吧
Yeah. Maybe.

570
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:26,820
我不会骗你
Oh, I'm not gonna lie to you.

571
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:28,620
这很糟糕 有时候糟糕的感觉
It sucks, and sometimes

572
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:31,136
还会持续一阵子
it's got to suck for a while.

573
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,180
我真希望我可以说出什么咒语
I just wish I could say some magic words

574
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,140
或是拥抱你 就让这感觉烟消云散
or give you a hug -- make it all go away.

575
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:51,520
你说我可以抿一口威士忌 还算话吗
Can I still have a sip of that scotch like you said?

576
00:19:58,538 --> 00:20:00,451
我刚开了一瓶
Okay, I just opened a bottle,

577
00:20:00,451 --> 00:20:01,706
18年[岁]陈酿
A beautiful 18-year-old,

578
00:20:01,706 --> 00:20:02,700
味道醇厚[身材好]
full-bodied.

579
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:03,100
萨姆
Sam!

580
00:20:03,620 --> 00:20:05,820
好啦 好啦
Okay. Okay.

581
00:20:36,560 --> 00:20:37,960
马可
Marco!

582
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:41,780
马可
Marco!

583
00:20:43,120 --> 00:20:43,500
波罗
Polo?

584
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:44,740
马可
Marco!

585
00:20:47,860 --> 00:20:49,260
马可
Marco!

586
00:20:50,660 --> 00:20:53,500
波罗 波罗 波罗
Polo! Polo! Polo!

587
00:20:57,540 --> 00:20:59,400
大半夜的谁会按门铃啊
Who rings the bell in the middle of the night?

588
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,660
真令人毛骨悚然
It is the creepiest thing.

589
00:21:00,740 --> 00:21:01,780
我不知道 我肯定只是
I'm sure it's just, I don't know,

590
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:03,960
某人车坏了 想借我家电话
Some guy's car broke down and he wants to use our phone.

591
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,700
你没看过恐怖片吗
Have you ever seen a movie?

592
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:08,840
你还记得你们离开旅馆房间时
Okay, do you remember how sad I was

593
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,220
我有多伤心吗
when you guys left the hotel room?

594
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:12,160
菲尔 门外是什么人
Phil, what is on the other side of that door?

595
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,540
-你好 马可 -各位好
- Hi, Marco. - Hey, guys.

596
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:16,260
我说"你们应该来我家玩"
It's possible they misunderstood me

597
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:17,680
他们有可能误会了
when I said, "You guys should stop by."

598
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:19,700
你们应该来我家玩
Yeah, "You guys should stop by."

599
00:21:21,460 --> 00:21:21,860
马可
Marco!

600
00:21:23,940 --> 00:21:24,560
这下可好
All right.

601
00:21:24,560 --> 00:21:27,280
什么情况
What is happening?!
